so-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">설계회사 등으로 취창업 활동을 지원하기 위한 교육생을 아래와 같이 모집합니다</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><!--[endif]--><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">◉ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교육대상</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">&nbsp; 주민등록상 경북 도내에 주소를 둔 여성 중 취창업 의사가 분명하고 교육에 적극적으로 참여하고자 하는 여성 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">명 선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ∙ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교육생 선발 시 현재 취업중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">고용보험 가입</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이거나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">본인명의 사업자 등록 보유자는 교육대상에 해당 안됨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ∙ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">취약계층 여성은 정원의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20% </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">범위 내에서 우선 선발가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">관련 서류 제출 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">방통대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">야간대 재학생은 재학증명서 제출 시 참여가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">야간수업 명기</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><!--[if !supportEmptyParas]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"> <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">※ </span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">금오공대 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학기차 여학생들의 많은 참여바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.<span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><spa